    {
      "id": "fused_8",
      "source": "ocr",
      "class_label": "I create, test, and photograph all of the recipes on Bright-Eyed\nBaker. I LOVE desserts and other baked goods - so you'll find\nplenty of those here - but I'm also a big fan of coffee and a good\ncraft cocktail. Be on the lookout for those recipes as well!",
      "bbox": [
        703.0,
